        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Summary\r\nOnline Auction Date: 22nd October 2026.\r\nDetached two bedroom thatched cottage.\r\nIn good condition throughout. \r\nExceptional one-off property with unique and traditional features.\r\nExtending to approximately 169 sq. m (1,819 sq. ft).\r\nLocated approximately 7km from Duleek town.\r\nSite area extending to approximately 0.11 hectare (0.27 acre).\r\nVacant possession.\r\n\r\nProperty Description\r\nPMC Real Estate are delighted to offer for sale this well laid out and spacious detached two bedroom thatched cottage. The property is presented in good condition throughout and benefits from enclosed mature garden in a private countryside setting.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall, open plan kitchen/dining area, living room with solid fuel stove, two double bedrooms (master en-suite), family bathroom & storage/hot press. Local amenities can be accessed in nearby Duleek and include a range of shops, schools, bars, restaurants & sports clubs.\r\n\r\nTenancy\r\nVacant Possession\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\nEntrance: \r\nDining Room: \r\nKitchen: \r\nLiving Room:\r\nBedroom One: \r\nBedroom Two: \r\nEnsuite: \r\nFamily Bathroom: \r\nStorage/Hot Press: \r\n\r\nAdditional Details\r\nFor further information regarding the auction process, registering to bid and viewing the property please contact Patrick McCormack on 086-4634687"
